      "writtenOn": "2023-11-15T21:04:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I did not want to let \"own address\" be unset while device mode interrupts were enabled.  I do not think that is important, though, as the bit 15 of the OAR1 register is an \"enable\" bit, without which no device interrupts will be generated.\n\nAlso, it was mostly a reflex to tear down in the opposite order of setting up things.",
